partcad-collection-openusd-nvidia
=================================

This PartCAD package serves NVIDIA's Omniverse sample content as PartCAD parts.

The code in this repository (the `nvidia_repo.py` repository plugin, the shared
`usd_assets.py`, the PartCAD configuration and the tests) is:

