No asset is included in this repository. The assets, their layers and their
textures are fetched on demand from NVIDIA's public bucket omniverse-content-production,
and remain NVIDIA's, under the NVIDIA Omniverse License Agreement
(https://docs.omniverse.nvidia.com/platform/latest/common/NVIDIA_Omniverse_License_Agreement.html).

